BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 619.24 Tm (Real numbers include all rational and irrational numbers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 603.34 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 587.44 Tm (Rational numbers can be written in the form p/q, where p is an integer and q is a non-zero natural) Tj ET
