BT /F2 13 Tf 0.05 0.16 0.51 rg 1 0 0 1 56 781.89 Tm (1.6  Worked Examples) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 56 763.04 Tm (Example 1. Express 0.333... in the form p/q, where p is an integer and q is a natural number.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 745.09 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 729.19 Tm (Let x = 0.333...) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 713.29 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 697.39 Tm (10x = 3.333...) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 681.49 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 665.59 Tm (Subtracting, 10x - x = 3.333... - 0.333...) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 649.69 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 633.79 Tm (Therefore 9x = 3 and x = 3/9 = 1/3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 56 609.89 Tm (Example 2. Prove that sqrt\(5\) is irrational.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 591.94 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 576.04 Tm (Assume, to the contrary, that sqrt\(5\) is rational.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 560.14 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 544.24 Tm (Then sqrt\(5\) = a/b, where a and b are coprime integers and b is not 0.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 528.34 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 512.44 Tm (Squaring, 5 = a^2 / b^2, so a^2 = 5b^2.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 496.54 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 480.64 Tm (This forces 5 to divide a^2, hence 5 divides a, so a = 5c.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 464.74 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 448.84 Tm (Then 25c^2 = 5b^2, giving b^2 = 5c^2, so 5 divides b as well.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 432.94 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 417.04 Tm (This contradicts the assumption that a and b are coprime.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.05 0.39 0.9 rg 1 0 0 1 56 401.14 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 70 385.24 Tm (Therefore sqrt\(5\) is irrational.) Tj ET
